      "chunk_text": "The customer, Dev Chatterjee, called insurance agent Suresh Deshmukh to inquire about his health policy. The agent informed him that the policy (HL-45789) had lapsed and expired on 15/08/2026. The customer expressed surprise and mentioned he might be considering switching providers. Ultimately, the customer decided to keep the policy expired for now and think about his options later.",
